---
import ExternalArrow from '../components/ExternalArrow.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import InstagramLink from '../components/InstagramLink.astro';
import site from '../../site.config.mjs';
---
<Base title="About" active="about">
  <div class="about">
    <p class="intro">A closer look.</p>
    <p>I’m Andrew, a photographer based in Taipei and San Francisco.</p>
    <p>People, places, and the details in between. These are a few of the things I’ve stopped to photograph over the years.</p>
    <div class="about-links">
      {site.instagramUrl && <InstagramLink href={site.instagramUrl} text />}
      <a href="https://andrewng.com/">andrewng.com <ExternalArrow /></a>
      <a href={site.sourceUrl}>Source on GitHub <ExternalArrow /></a>
    </div>
    <div class="colophon">
      <h2>A little history</h2>
      <p>This portfolio was originally hosted by <a href="https://pullfolio.com/">Pullfolio</a>, a service I helped build to turn Flickr into photography websites. Pullfolio ran from 2009 to 2024. The service is gone; the photographs live on.</p>
      <p class="service-note">This product uses the Flickr API but is not endorsed or certified by SmugMug, Inc.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
